{"731340": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "EscapeNET", "steam_appid": 731340, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE NARRATIVE:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>EscapeNET</strong>. Humanity has fallen. AI rules. And<strong> you are its experiment. </strong>The AI watches, and adapts — every mistake fuels its knowledge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EscapeNET</strong> is a multiplayer co-op light horror experience where <strong>2–4 players</strong> are thrown into a network of deadly chambers designed to test every aspect of human skill, puzzle solving, strategy, and survival. Survive deadly puzzles, navigate unseen dangers with drone-assisted teammates, and compete against your friends in high-stakes arenas — all while racing against time. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One wrong move can mean instant deletion. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can’t hide from the code.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE NARRATIVE:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>EscapeNET</strong>. Humanity has fallen. AI rules. And<strong> you are its experiment. </strong>The AI watches, and adapts — every mistake fuels its knowledge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EscapeNET</strong> is a multiplayer co-op light horror experience where <strong>2–4 players</strong> are thrown into a network of deadly chambers designed to test every aspect of human skill, puzzle solving, strategy, and survival. Survive deadly puzzles, navigate unseen dangers with drone-assisted teammates, and compete against your friends in high-stakes arenas — all while racing against time. </